        text: "The {purist_uprising} set the stage for everything that followed. When {brother_halix} was captured at {havens_rest}, the {iron_covenant} saw an opening. {kaine_durgan} led the assault on {silica} — not out of hatred, but cold strategy. The {mirror_order} defenders fought bravely. {silica} fell. Whether it was necessary remains debated.",
